# kind: 8-line-priority-encoder
# generator: LogicalOptimizer.Benchmarks PlaCorpusGenerator (deterministic)
# regenerate: dotnet run -c Release --project LogicalOptimizer.Benchmarks -- generate-corpora
# note: v=1 and (y2 y1 y0)=index of highest asserted request line, r7 highest; no request => all outputs 0 (fd)
.i 8
.o 4
.ilb r7 r6 r5 r4 r3 r2 r1 r0
.ob v y2 y1 y0
.p 8
1------- 1111
01------ 1110
001----- 1101
0001---- 1100
00001--- 1011
000001-- 1010
0000001- 1001
00000001 1000
.e
